<view class="page blocked-page"><view class="page-title">让相处更自在。</view><view class="subtitle">屏蔽后，对方的帖子和评论会向你隐藏。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取屏蔽列表…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="btn btn-secondary" bindtap="refresh">重新加载</button></view><view wx:elif="{{items.length === 0}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-symbol">🌿</view><view class="empty-title">没有已屏蔽的用户</view><view class="muted">你可以在帖子或评论的更多菜单中屏蔽用户。</view></view><view wx:else><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="blocked-user card row"><image class="avatar" src="{{item.avatar || '/assets/avatar-1.png'}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="user-name"><view>{{item.nickname}}</view></view><button class="unblock-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="unblock" disabled="{{busy}}">取消屏蔽</button></view></view><button wx:if="{{nextCursor && !loading}}" class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="loadMore" loading="{{moreBusy}}" disabled="{{moreBusy}}">查看更多用户</button></view>
